        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The SSO's annual outdoor concert featuring Stratford Symphony Orchestra musicians and special guests in a magical garden setting.&nbsp;    Enjoy a stroll through the perennial gardens, visit the cows, have a glass of wine, enjoy the nibbles and treats. Tickets are available  here."
      }
