      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Hogtown Brass Quintet are very excited to be a part of Public Radio Exchange's The Memory Palace taping on Monday, May 16 at The Great Hall in Toronto  The memory palace is a storytelling podcast and public radio segment about the past. It was named a finalist for a Peabody Award in 2016.  Unfor"
