    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The HBQ is thrilled to be able to support SONG - Sounds of the Next Generation, in Cobourg, ON.&nbsp;  SONG is a musical community where kids can learn, create, and be part of a team. Participants sing in choir and play in a violin ensemble several times each week. All instruments and music are"
