        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Going back to where we recorded our first album, Toronto Chamber Players presents a noon hour concert in the Atrium of Timothy Eaton Memorial Church.&nbsp;  Pay what you can at the door Come share your lunch hour with the brass quintet"
